    text b5 "Не име́й сто рубле́й…  friends" say "Не име́й сто рубле́й, а име́й сто друзе́й." x 500 y 200 font_size 44 hidden true

A: Today: Russian sayings, посло́вицы. The first is made (@draw p1@) of words you know, plus по́здно, late:
    draw title p1_clock

B: Лу́чше по́здно, чем никогда́.
    highlight p1 color #5b8c5a effect underline

A: As in English, you say it (@@) when someone (@highlight p1_w_2 color #5b8c5a effect underline@) turns up, or starts, at last.

    erase p1 p1_clock title

B: Без труда́ не вы́тащишь и ры́бку из пруда́.
    draw p2 p2_fish p2_rod

A: Без is without, and труд is (@draw p2_bez@) work. After без comes the of-ending: (@highlight p2_w_2 color #1a8a8a effect underline@) без труда́.

    erase p2_bez

A: So: without work, you won't pull even a little (@draw p2_fishword@) fish, a ры́бка, out of a pond.

    erase p2_fishword

A: You say it to someone who wants results with no effort. And it rhymes: труда́, пруда́.
    highlight p2_w_2 p2_w_8 color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase p2 p2_fish p2_rod

A: Late at night, with a hard choice to make, Russians say:
    draw p3_moon

B: У́тро ве́чера мудрене́е.
    draw p3 p3_sun

A: Мудрене́е is wiser. And ве́чера, in the of-ending, means than the evening, with no чем.
    highlight p3_w_2 color #1a8a8a effect underline

A: So: sleep (@draw p3_chem@) on it. Fairy tales say it on the night before a hard task.

    erase p3 p3_moon p3_sun p3_chem

B: Ти́ше (@draw p4_turtle p4_flag@) е́дешь — да́льше бу́дешь.
    draw p4 p4_car p4_crash

A: Е́дешь and бу́дешь you know. Ти́ше and (@draw p4_she@) да́льше end in ше, like лу́чше and бо́льше.

    erase p4_she

A: Ти́ше is quieter, or slower: (@draw p4_med@) ме́дленнее. Say it to someone in a hurry: go slower, and you'll get further.

    erase p4 p4_turtle p4_car p4_crash p4_flag p4_med

A: Now just listen: Tom thanks Masha, and the fifth saying is in it.
    draw ear

A: Ма́ша, ты мне помога́ешь ка́ждый день. Спаси́бо!
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name caption false

B: Пожа́луйста! Ты мой друг.
    draw l_heart caption false

A: А я тебе́ ничего́ не дарю́…
    caption false

B: Ничего́! Не име́й сто рубле́й, а име́й сто друзе́й.
    draw l_money l_friends caption false

    erase l_heart l_money l_friends

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    ask "What is it better to have, says the saying?" voice b options ["a hundred roubles","a hundred friends","a hundred presents"] correct 2 reveal.text "сто друзе́й" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 58 reveal.color #3d3833
        listen: Не име́й сто рубле́й, а име́й сто друзе́й.
        right: A hundred friends: сто друзе́й.
        wrong: Listen for the end: сто друзе́й, a hundred friends.

    erase ear

A: Here it is. Име́й is a formal word for have; day (@draw p5_imey@) to day, you say у меня́ есть.
    draw l1 l2 l3 l4 p5

    erase p5_imey

A: Друзе́й, many (@draw p5_rhyme@) friends, rhymes with рубле́й. Say (@draw p5_money p5_friends@) it when a friend helps you out.

    erase l1 l2 l3 l4 p5 p5_rhyme p5_money p5_friends

A: Now the night before Tom's (@draw d_book@) exam. Listen; then tap Practise after the dialogue to say it yourself.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk d_book

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: New there: за час, in an hour, and (@draw n2 n2g n_bed@) иду́ спать, I'm off to bed.
    draw n1 n1g

    erase n1 n1g n2 n2g n_bed

    draw q_clock

    quiz "Лу́чше по́здно, чем ___." above q_clock reveal.text "Лу́чше по́здно, чем никогда́." reveal.style label reveal.size 58 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Никогда́: better late than never.
        wrong: Better late than never: никогда́.
        * всегда́
        + никогда́
        * иногда́

    erase q_clock

    draw q_moon

    quiz "It's midnight, and your friend wants to decide something big right now. What do you say?" above q_moon reveal.text "У́тро ве́чера мудрене́е." reveal.style label reveal.size 58 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: У́тро ве́чера мудрене́е: sleep on it.
        wrong: Decide in the morning: у́тро ве́чера мудрене́е.
        * Ти́ше е́дешь — да́льше бу́дешь.
        * Лу́чше по́здно, чем никогда́.
        + У́тро ве́чера мудрене́е.

    erase q_moon

    draw q_rod

    quiz "Без труда́ не вы́тащишь и ры́бку из пруда́. What does it mean?" above q_rod say_answer false reveal.text "без труда́" reveal.style label reveal.size 58 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Without work, not even a little fish.
        wrong: Без труда́: without work, you won't pull out even a little fish.
        + Nothing good comes without effort.
        * Fishing takes patience.
        * Don't start what you can't finish.

    erase q_rod

    draw q_friends

    ask say_it "Не име́й сто рубле́й, а име́й сто друзе́й." gloss "Don't have a hundred roubles, have a hundred friends." voice b show cue reveal.text "…а име́й сто друзе́й." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 58 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1

    erase q_friends

    draw q_turtle

    ask "Finish the saying. Type the last word: Ти́ше е́дешь — да́льше ___." above q_turtle answer ["будешь"] reveal.text "да́льше бу́дешь" reveal.style label reveal.size 58 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Бу́дешь: go slower, and you'll get further.
        wrong: It's бу́дешь, you will be: да́льше бу́дешь.

    erase q_turtle

    group sum members ["b1","b2","b3","b4","b5"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: Five sayings: for hard work, for being late, for sleeping on it, against rushing, and for friends.
    highlight sum color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase sum

B: Пока́! У́тро ве́чера мудрене́е.
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon end_moon size 100 set twemoji x 680 y 560 or ["first quarter moon face"] icon_look picture of "crescent moon"
    text end_say "Пока́! У́тро ве́чера мудрене́е." say "Пока́! У́тро ве́чера мудрене́е." say_voice b x 500 y 290 font_size 44

    erase end_masha end_moon end_say

